WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.750
Step 1: Open the checklist’s Plans stage. Choose Set up planner if none exists, or Edit planner to change its single planner.

2
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:20.833
Step 2: Choose recurrence, a start date and fixed times or location trading hours. Plan breakdown shows repeats, active hours and deadlines. Expand Current and next runs for exact windows. Planners continue until paused; once off still runs once.

3
00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:26.833
Step 3: Use Locations and Assignees to choose who should receive that planner’s work.

4
00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:38.667
Step 4: Review the saved planner and activate it when ready. Older checklists with several planners must use Keep this planner to choose one; the others stop creating work while saved records remain in History.
